  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Introduction to the Watcher</h2>\n<p>The Watcher is an entity tasked with observing curses and ensuring the balance between the Watcher and the Curse. This role is governed by a higher power that controls the laboratory and the fate of worlds. For a long time, the Watcher&#x27;s purpose was unquestioned until the arrival of Iphania, a princess who knew her world was doomed.</p>\n<h2>The Watcher&#x27;s Transformation</h2>\n<p>After meeting Iphania, the Watcher began to question the nature of its role. This encounter fundamentally altered the Watcher&#x27;s perspective, leading to a deeper contemplation of the world and the hero&#x27;s ability to save others. The Watcher saw someone who could destroy a prison and change fate, but also realized they were wrong about the Outsider, who was doomed by the princess&#x27;s actions.</p>\n<h2>The Fate of the Outsider and the Future</h2>\n<p>The Watcher now understands that fighting fate is futile, but there may still be a chance to prevent the Outsider&#x27;s actions. A call is made to join in an effort to correct a flawed future, with the goal of making right a future that went wrong.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9A1cO7jL0jw</p>",
